y l\'e0 c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp li\'ean doanh gi\u7919\'3fa qu\u7889\'3fc doanh v\u7899\'3fi t\u7853\'3fp th\u7875\'3f (bao g\u7891\'3fm c\u7843\'3f t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc l\'e0m kinh t\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c c\'f5 quan h\'e0nh ch\'ednh v
