\u7863\'3fc nhi\u7873\'3fu t\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c th\'e0nh ph\u7847\'3fn kinh t\u7871\'3f v\u7899\'3fi nhau (d\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y g\u7885\'3f chung l\'e0 x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp li\'ean doanh \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'f5 quan Nh
