\u7879\'3fp li\'ean doanh theo bi\u7875\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc doanh nghi\u7879\'3fp l\u361\'3fy ti\u7871\'3fn t\'fdng ph\u7847\'3fn ban h\'e0ng theo ph\'e1p l\u7879\'3fnh ng\'e0y 03 th\'e1ng 3 n\'e3m 1989 s\u7917\'3fa \'f0\u7893\'3f
i b\u7893\'3f sung m\u7897\'3ft s\u7889\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm trong \'f0i\u7873\'3fu l\u7879\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c Ph\'e1p l\u7879\'3fnh v\u7873\'3f thu\u7871\'3f c\'f4ng th\'fd\'f5ng nghi\u7879\'3fp v\'e0 thu\u7871\'3f h\'e0ng h\'f3a.
\par L\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f l\'e0 t\u7893\'3fng doanh thu c\u7897\'3fng (+) c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3 ), tr\u7915\'3f (-) c\'e1c kh\u7887\'3fan hao ph\'ed v\u7853\'3ft ch
\u7845\'3ft ti\u7873\'3fn kh\u7845\'3fu hao t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh, c\'e1c ph\'ed t\u7893\'3fn h\u7907\'3fp l\u7879\'3f v\'e0 ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
