\'ea ngo\'e0i th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f tham gia s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft k\u7883\'3fnh doanh mang l\u7841\'3fi hi\u7879\'3fu qu\u7843\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f.
\par X\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp li\'ean doanh kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc b\u7893\'3f sung khi l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f tr\'fd\u7907\'3ft qu\'e1 m\u7913\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh trong bi
